<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE III: </span><span id="A1.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ambiguous Hardware Task Instructions.</span> 40 ambiguous task instructions used for the calibration dataset are listed here. During testing, we randomly sample 20 instructions from the set and obtain new options with the new action samples from the base policy.</figcaption>
