<figure id="A1.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22474v1/sim_setup.png" id="A1.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/80;" width="476" height="80" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 10: </span><span id="A1.F10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Simulation Setup.</span> We demonstrate our simulated task setup using a Franka Emika Panda arm. The leftmost two images show the initial environment setup, while the right four images show the target configurations for the two behavior modes, as labeled. In each image pair, the left image provides the third-person camera view and the right image provides the wrist view.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
