<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE VI: </span><span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Straightforward Simulation Task Instructions.</span> 60 straightforward task instructions used for the calibration and test datasets are listed here. 40 of these are randomly sampled to be part of the calibration set, while the remaining 20 make up the test set. We use “c.c.w.” and “c.w.” to denote “counterclockwise” and “clockwise” respectively.</figcaption>
</figure>
